 "text": "# Receitas\n\nType: Guide. Explanatory page about using the kit.\nSection: Extras do kit\nHuman version (rendered examples): extras/receitas.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\ncro-* / is-* classes in this page: cro-box cro-box__frame cro-btn cro-check cro-field cro-input cro-label cro-progress cro-progress__bar cro-slot cro-slot-grid cro-slot__qty cro-tab-panel cro-tab-panels cro-tabs cro-tabs__btn cro-titlebar cro-titlebar__title cro-window cro-window__body cro-window__footer is-active is-selected\ndata-cro-* attributes in this page: data-cro-panel data-cro-panels data-cro-tab data-cro-tabs\n\nTelas completas montadas com o kit, para copiar e adaptar.\n\n## Janela de login\n\n```\n<section class=\"cro-window\" style=\"width:300px\">\n  <header class=\"cro-titlebar\"><span class=\"cro-titlebar__title\">Login</span></header>\n  <div class=\"cro-window__body\">\n    <div class=\"cro-field\">\n      <label class=\"cro-label\" for=\"rc-u\">Usuário</label>\n      <input class=\"cro-input\" id=\"rc-u\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cro-field\">\n      <label class=\"cro-label\" for=\"rc-p\">Senha</label>\n      <input class=\"cro-input\" id=\"rc-p\" type=\"password\">\n    </div>\n    <label class=\"cro-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Lembrar usuário</label>\n  </div>\n  <footer class=\"cro-window__footer\">\n    <button class=\"cro-btn\">Cancelar</button>\n    <button class=\"cro-btn\">Entrar</button>\n  </footer>\n</section>\n```\n\n## O mesmo com Bootstrap puro\n\n```\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"width:300px\">\n  <div class=\"card-header\">Login</div>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <div class=\"mb-2\">\n      <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"rb-u\">Usuário</label>\n      <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"rb-u\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mb-2\">\n      <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"rb-p\">Senha</label>\n      <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"rb-p\" type=\"password\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"form-check\">\n      <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"rb-k\" checked>\n      <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"rb-k\">Lembrar usuário</label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card-footer d-flex gap-2 justify-content-end\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Cancelar</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\">Entrar</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Painel de status\n\n```\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width:300px\">\n  <div class=\"card-header\">Status</div>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between\"><span>HP</span><small>820/1000</small></div>\n    <div class=\"progress mb-2\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"height:9px\">\n      <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" style=\"width:82%\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between\"><span>SP</span><small>90/200</small></div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" style=\"height:9px\">\n      <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width:45%\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Inventário com abas\n\n```\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width:360px\">\n  <div class=\"card-header\">Inventário</div>\n  <div class=\"card-body p-2\">\n    <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n      <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n        <button\n          class=\"nav-link active\"\n          data-bs-toggle=\"tab\"\n          data-bs-target=\"#rc-i1\"\n          type=\"button\"\n          role=\"tab\">\n          Item\n        </button>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n        <button\n          class=\"nav-link\"\n          data-bs-toggle=\"tab\"\n          data-bs-target=\"#rc-i2\"\n          type=\"button\"\n          role=\"tab\">\n          Equip\n        </button>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"tab-content pt-2\">\n      <div class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"rc-i1\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n        <div class=\"cro-slot-grid\" style=\"width:192px\">\n          <div class=\"cro-slot\"><span class=\"cro-slot__qty\">12</span></div>\n          <div class=\"cro-slot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cro-slot is-selected\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cro-slot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cro-slot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cro-slot\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"rc-i2\" role=\"tabpanel\">Equipamentos.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Página completa: login, abas, confirmação e barra de HP (peças nativas)\n\nA tela mais comum de um teste, pronta e fiel ao jogo. Um só tipo de botão (cro-btn), janelas de largura fixa, rodapé como irmão do corpo, CRO.confirm com await. Salve como index.html ao lado de c-ro-bs.min.css, c-ro-bs.min.js e da pasta fonts/ (ou troque os dois endereços pelos de https://kevencastilho.github.io/C-RO_WebKit/dist/).\n\n```\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>C-RO: login, abas, confirmação e HP</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"c-ro-bs.min.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:24px; align-items:flex-start\">\n      <!-- Login: o rodapé é IRMÃO do corpo, não vai dentro dele -->\n      <section class=\"cro-window\" style=\"width:300px\">\n        <header class=\"cro-titlebar\"><span class=\"cro-titlebar__title\">Login</span></header>\n        <div class=\"cro-window__body\">\n          <div class=\"cro-field\">\n            <label class=\"cro-label\" for=\"usuario\">Usuário</label>\n            <input class=\"cro-input\" id=\"usuario\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cro-field\">\n            <label class=\"cro-label\" for=\"senha\">Senha</label>\n            <input class=\"cro-input\" id=\"senha\" type=\"password\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <footer class=\"cro-window__footer\">\n          <button class=\"cro-btn\" id=\"entrar\">Entrar</button>\n        </footer>\n      </section>\n      <!-- Personagem: abas nativas + barra de HP -->\n      <section class=\"cro-window\" style=\"width:340px\">\n        <header class=\"cro-titlebar\">\n          <span class=\"cro-titlebar__title\">Personagem</span>\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"cro-window__body\">\n          <div data-cro-tabs data-cro-panels=\"#paineis\">\n            <div class=\"cro-tabs\">\n              <button class=\"cro-tabs__btn is-active\" data-cro-tab=\"status\">Status</button>\n              <button class=\"cro-tabs__btn\" data-cro-tab=\"equip\">Equipamento</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cro-tab-panels\" id=\"paineis\">\n            <div class=\"cro-tab-panel\" data-cro-panel=\"status\">\n              <p>HP 600 / 1000</p>\n              <div class=\"cro-progress\">\n                <div class=\"cro-progress__bar\" style=\"--p:60\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <p><button class=\"cro-btn\" id=\"sair\">Sair da guilda?</button></p>\n              <div class=\"cro-box\">\n                <div class=\"cro-box__frame\" id=\"resultado\">Nenhuma escolha feita.</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"cro-tab-panel\" data-cro-panel=\"equip\" hidden>\n              <p>Nenhum equipamento.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n    <script src=\"c-ro-bs.min.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n    document.getElementById('entrar').addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      await CRO.alert('Bem-vindo, ' + (document.getElementById('usuario').value || 'aventureiro') + '!');\n    });\n    document.getElementById('sair').addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const sim = await CRO.confirm('Você realmente quer sair da guilda?', { ok: 'Sim', cancel: 'Não' });\n      document.getElementById('resultado').textContent = sim ? 'Você escolheu: SIM' : 'Você escolheu: NÃO';\n    });\n  </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n## A mesma tela com Bootstrap dentro das janelas do jogo\n\nJanelas nativas (cro-window) com formulário, abas e botões do Bootstrap. Funciona igual e é bom quando você já escreve Bootstrap. Regra: dentro da mesma tela use btn ou cro-btn, não os dois.\n\n```\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>C-RO: Bootstrap com janelas do jogo</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"c-ro-bs.min.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:24px; align-items:flex-start\">\n      <section class=\"cro-window\" style=\"width:300px\">\n        <header class=\"cro-titlebar\"><span class=\"cro-titlebar__title\">Login</span></header>\n        <div class=\"cro-window__body\">\n          <div class=\"mb-2\">\n            <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"usuario\">Usuário</label>\n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"usuario\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mb-2\">\n            <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"senha\">Senha</label>\n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"senha\" type=\"password\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <footer class=\"cro-window__footer\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" id=\"entrar\">Entrar</button>\n        </footer>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"cro-window\" style=\"width:340px\">\n        <header class=\"cro-titlebar\">\n          <span class=\"cro-titlebar__title\">Personagem</span>\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"cro-window__body\">\n          <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n            <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n              <button\n                class=\"nav-link active\"\n                data-bs-toggle=\"tab\"\n                data-bs-target=\"#aba-status\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                role=\"tab\">\n                Status\n              </button>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n              <button\n                class=\"nav-link\"\n                data-bs-toggle=\"tab\"\n                data-bs-target=\"#aba-equip\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                role=\"tab\">\n                Equipamento\n              </button>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"tab-content pt-2\">\n            <div class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"aba-status\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n              <p class=\"mb-1\">HP 600 / 1000</p>\n              <div class=\"cro-progress\">\n                <div class=\"cro-progress__bar\" style=\"--p:60\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"mt-2\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" id=\"sair\">Sair da guilda?</button>\n              </p>\n              <div id=\"resultado\">Nenhuma escolha feita.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"aba-equip\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n              <p>Nenhum equipamento.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n    <script src=\"c-ro-bs.min.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n    document.getElementById('sair').addEventListener('click', async () => {\n      const sim = await CRO.confirm('Você realmente quer sair da guilda?', { ok: 'Sim', cancel: 'Não' });\n      document.getElementById('resultado').textContent = sim ? 'Você escolheu: SIM' : 'Você escolheu: NÃO';\n    });\n  </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n## Confirmação com async/await\n\n```\ndocument.querySelector('#excluir').addEventListener('click', async () => {\n  if (await CRO.confirm('Excluir o personagem?', { ok: 'Excluir', cancel: 'Cancelar' })) {\n    await CRO.alert('Personagem excluído.');\n  }\n});\n```\n\n« Fidelidade: confirmado e derivado · O que não existe »\n",
